# Copy to .env.local and adjust. PROVISIONAL — docforum-core has no
# implemented API yet; this is the assumed local dev port, not a confirmed
# contract. See src/services/api-client.ts.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000

# Error monitoring (disabled unless set). Set to a Sentry DSN to enable
# automatic error capture in production. The Pages preview ships without
# this, so monitoring is off by default. All captured events are scrubbed
# by src/utils/phi-scrubber.ts before they leave the browser — see
# ARCHITECTURE_ESSENTIALS.md "Known assumptions — Error monitoring".
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://<key>@o<org>.ingest.sentry.io/<project>
